  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of MFA/Danida participation at Ungdommens Folkem&#xf8;de 2020 is to make an impact in relation to the MFA&#x2019;s commitment to raise awareness and public engagement in the Danish development cooperation - in this case Danish students. The commitment is founded in the Law on International Development Cooperation and highlighted in the Development Policy Strategy &#x201c;The World we Share&#x201d; from 2021.</narrative>
  </description>
